{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12107230","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12107230","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1210723001:0":{"text":"索尼娅为什么停下了脚步？","source_cn":"索尼娅为什么停下了脚步？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF674E3644C7A1FB3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1210723002:0":{"text":"因为在犹豫吧，毕竟敌人是妹妹，难道要亲手杀死亲妹妹？","source_cn":"因为在犹豫吧，毕竟敌人是妹妹，难道要亲手杀死亲妹妹？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EC81065933600EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1210723003:1":{"text":"其实……我已经“杀死”过她一次。","source_cn":"其实……我已经“杀死”过她一次。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CE85812B8676C96","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1210723004:1":{"text":"怎么回事？","source_cn":"怎么回事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD7E9DE7E9BED4FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1210723005:1":{"text":"我和奈拉从小在锈锚港长大，我们没有父母，找不到工作，只能靠偷东西过活。奈拉不喜欢这样的生活，她想离开这里，所以我们攒钱，买了两张船票。","source_cn":"我和奈拉从小在锈锚港长大，我们没有父母，找不到工作，只...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0456E4929615C292","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":"